WEBVTT

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.190
At present, the appearance of
monster hordes has been confirmed

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:31.280
at two locations within the kingdom.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.360
One horde has begun to move,

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.820
heading north and attacking
villages along the way.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:38.910
The Lugget Highlands?

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:42.580
The horde that appeared halfway between
here and Karanak, the City of Requiem,

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:44.750
has begun to move east.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:48.840
Currently, the King's Guard
is holding them at bay, but...

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.130
The situation is not looking good.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:55.680
So, the monsters are headed here.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:56.760
Yes.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:59.300
Hordes of 10,000 monsters...

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.930
No, this is an army now.

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.020
It's just like 30 years ago.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.230
No, it's a little different.

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:11.020
The Nine Wise Men are not all here now.

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:14.490
Suleiman, send for Luminaria immediately.

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:16.450
We'll send her against the monsters
in the Lugget Highlands.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:18.660
What should we tell our
neighboring kingdoms?

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.200
There's no need to hide things.

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:23.160
We are subduing a mass outbreak
of monsters in our kingdom.

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:25.250
Let them know that we won't trouble them.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:26.370
Yes, sire.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:29.130
I wish we could do something
about how the cease-fire agreement

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:31.960
restricts us from making free use
of our military forces.

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:33.510
It cannot be helped.

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:34.510
Worst case scenario,

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:36.970
it could become an excuse
to scrap the agreement.

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:38.680
I know that.

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:40.760
When do you think Mira will get back?

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:43.930
She headed for the Child of Prayer
Forest only just yesterday.

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:45.890
I believe it will take at least five days.

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:47.560
Hmm...

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:49.480
Send Garrett to the Child of Prayer Forest

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:50.810
to inform Mira of the current situation

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.570
and tell her to return
as soon as possible.

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:53.940
Understood.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:56.740
--Oh.
--Hm?

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:59.700
That is, I hate to bring this up,

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:02.530
but Mistress Luminaria
has the day off today.

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:03.370
Huh?

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:06.960
I believe, in all likelihood,
she is shopping in the castle town.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:10.880
As I recall, she mentioned something
about new outfit designs coming out.

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:16.550
Go find her right away!

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:17.800
Yes, sire.

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:21.300
Mira!

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.260
Hurry back!

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.650
Is someone talking about me
behind my back?

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:09.580
Ten thousand really is a lot.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:12.660
"Episode 12
'I Have Arrived!'"
Oh, it's not all bad.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:13.670
"Episode 12
'I Have Arrived!'"

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:19.210
You can hit them without aiming.

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:22.470
Good point. That part is nice.

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:30.930
It's my first break in 30 days and
there's another monster attack?

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:32.810
And this time, it's a horde?

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:36.100
Are we sure there isn't something
buggy about this world?

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:39.230
I believe we will reach our
destination towards morning.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:40.900
Please rest now, while you can.

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:42.740
No, I'll be fine.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.650
Thanks for worrying about me.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.410
Oh, of course.

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:50.200
Mistress Luminaria,
I wish you luck in battle.

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.290
Thank you.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:58.340
I swear, you completely
ruined my rare day off.

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.460
Go get them!

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:06.680
Yes!

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:07.800
Huh?

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:18.310
This is starting to look like
a real pain in the ass.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:21.020
You, I want you to get
a message to His Majesty.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:22.110
What?

00:05:22.110 --> 00:05:26.530
Tell him it's going to take me
some time to smash 'em.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:38.880
These guys'll drop items, right?

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:43.170
She said it'd take time,
not that she couldn't defeat them.

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:45.220
She'll be fine.

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:47.300
The problem is...

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:49.760
We can hold this side at bay,
but not defeat them.

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:50.640
Yes.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:53.560
It can't be helped. I'll handle it.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:57.020
Please remain seated, Your Majesty.

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:58.770
Oh, but still...

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:01.270
There is no "but still" here.

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:04.610
What do you intend to do if something
were to happen to you?

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:06.570
If it's just for a bit...

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:09.030
No, you cannot, means no, you cannot.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:12.490
No. You. Can. Not.

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:14.040
All right.

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:32.760
Commander Reynard is fighting hard.

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:35.350
The fortress to the northwest
is still holding.

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:37.770
What news from Luminaria?

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:40.350
Sire, she says she wants a bath.

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.690
She'll be fine as is, then.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:45.070
She is certainly an Elder
for very good reason.

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:45.980
Message!

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:52.950
A new horde has appeared in
the woodlands to the northeast.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:55.620
They number roughly
the same at 10,000.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:57.700
Holy crap!

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:01.960
Your Majesty, the forces we can send
out from the capital are already...

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:03.290
I know.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:05.630
Worst case scenario, we face a siege here.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.160
A mystery summoner has arrived!

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:44.540
A mystery necromancer has come forth!

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:47.550
I shall be your opponent
in my master's place!

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:58.680
I won't allow you to get past us.

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:05.480
Huh? What did you say?

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:08.690
Two people claiming to be a mystery
summoner and necromancer

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:10.740
have begun to fight the monsters.

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:13.990
They are obviously Master Cleos
and Mistress Amalatte.

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:15.660
We should recall them at once.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:16.910
They are fine where they are.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:18.030
Your Majesty!

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.870
Acting Elders are second only to
the Nine Wise Men in fighting power.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:23.420
Committing excessive
military might near the border

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:26.040
will give our neighboring kingdoms
cause for misunderstandings.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:29.590
This is a unique opportunity to see
our grown acting Elders in battle

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:31.380
and assess their true abilities.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.170
That is true, but...

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:35.840
If the kingdom falls,
it'll all be for nothing.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:39.470
We'll say the two mystery persons
are well-meaning collaborators,

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:41.600
who aren't affiliated with us. How's that?

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:43.060
It will not pass muster.

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:45.650
Then, I'll leave the excuses to you.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:47.150
I understand.

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:51.860
I must stress that we ask the other
acting Elders to act with prudence.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:56.700
Now, then, all our forces
are fully committed.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:59.490
Beyond that, I would have
to sally forth myself, but...

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:05.670
The timing couldn't be more opportune,
you know?

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:06.920
Danblf.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.090
I have arrived!

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.060
These are...

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:33.150
Reynard, over there!

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:37.700
Miss Mira!

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:40.410
Miss Mira has arrived at
the fortress to the northwest.

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:43.620
She has begun to mop up the monsters
with Commander Reynard's people.

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:44.620
Your Majesty!

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:45.870
Yes.

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:47.920
Hell yes!

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:49.420
A message to Mira.

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:53.300
Tell her to head to the woodlands to
the northeast when she's done there.

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:54.460
Yes, sire.

00:09:56.930 --> 00:10:00.180
Now, it's our turn to go on the offensive.

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:06.730
Good work.

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:10.060
You're late. I'm working
on my day off here.

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:13.230
Well, your service is much appreciated.

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:14.530
What about the other places?

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:17.240
I heard that an additional
monster horde showed up?

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:21.830
A mystery summoner and necromancer
were taking care of them.

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:28.290
"Mystery," eh?

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:30.750
They have certainly grown.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:33.500
Well, it has been 30 years.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.710
So much to look forward to.

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:36.970
You said it.

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:39.510
Now, shall we head back?

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:40.550
Yeah.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:42.550
Back to our kingdom.

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:44.890
We have confirmation that all
the monsters have been wiped out.

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:47.480
Your Majesty, we are victorious!

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:49.810
Well done, everyone.

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:50.770
Now, then...

00:10:50.770 --> 00:10:52.810
Your Majesty, where are you going?

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:55.360
To go receive our heroes.

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.240
Ah.

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:07.660
Hey!

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:36.020
The hell is this?

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:39.820
Basically, like a super-huge
raid boss, I suppose?

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:44.240
Gack. We've only got three players.
What do we do?

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:46.280
You ask that as though we have a choice.

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:04.800
Our tank is raring to go.

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:08.890
It's great how he insists he's a tank
when he's built nothing like one.

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:12.020
If the drops suck after all this,
we'll totally be in the red.

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:15.230
Oh, we will have Solomon
cover all the costs.

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:17.770
I love the way you think!

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:20.070
Now, then, how do we defeat it?

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:22.150
Gotta go with Operation Meteors.

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:25.870
I find that operation
name questionable, but...

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.200
Well, I see no other choice.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.120
Pegasus, look after Luminaria for me.

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:42.130
"The parabolic arc of the meowsault
was a bridge to glory."
Nice landing, meow.

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:45.430
"Let's call the MAT"

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:45.430
Party Leader, are you
really doing it, meow?

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:46.760
Of course.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:51.020
And I want to test if
my technique is effective.

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:53.640
Now, then, I suppose I will begin.

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:09.990
We seven sisters have come in
answer to your summons.

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:12.120
Good of you to come.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:14.540
Our opponent on this occasion is that.

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:20.210
Compared to our dear sister Alfina's
training, this might be easy.

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:22.130
No need to even compare.

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:25.470
In terms of a training opponent,
this is more realistic.

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:27.890
Yes, it looks clobber-worthy.

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:30.600
But will our attacks get through?

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:33.430
Let us leave that to our
master and her people.

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:37.350
Our role will be to distract and confuse.
Will that be acceptable?

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:39.230
You have made this easy for me.

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:40.730
Then, I will be counting on you.

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:41.730
Yes!

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:45.450
"Singing out of the blue"

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:45.450
Leticia, come.

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:54.950
I say to my army...

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:56.080
Attack!

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:20.360
Things are going well.

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:22.150
Going with the usual strategy?

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:25.150
Mm, our job is to buy time.

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:26.570
Roger that.

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:28.150
But be careful, okay?

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:31.660
Even being grazed by
that attack is no joke.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:33.450
I am aware.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:35.000
Then, shall we go?

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.200
Very well!

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:57.060
With the three of us,
it is somewhat lacking, but...

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:59.940
...fighting together
with you guys is still...

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:02.560
...the most fun ever!

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.780
We have been waiting for that!

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:17.540
Take that!

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:19.290
How do you like that?

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:25.460
Just as tough as its size
would suggest, eh?

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:28.550
However, we are playing in Party Mode.

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:40.810
You seem to have kept yourself sharp.

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:42.100
I guess.

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:53.490
Here we go!

00:15:58.330 --> 00:15:59.910
Left yourself open!

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:04.750
I am pulling out all the stops!

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:08.840
Get it!

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:18.220
You okay?

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:21.270
Yes. I thought I was dead, though.

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:24.190
Time is up.

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:29.030
It even works on something that size?

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:32.400
No, I can barely keep it from moving.

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:34.610
Well, that is enough, though.

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:37.580
Your timing is perfect.

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:39.910
Take this!

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:42.750
Waltrud Meteor Nights!

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:50.260
All right! We won!

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:52.880
Time for the fun of looting!

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:59.310
It's still alive after that?!

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:01.390
What incredible HP it has!

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:02.980
What about Luminaria?

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:07.230
Out of gas, I see.

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:09.070
No choice, then.

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:12.070
O Valkyries!

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.040
Shoot to kill!

00:17:36.470 --> 00:17:37.840
Impressive as ever.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:39.220
Same to you.

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:46.270
We cannot dodge it at this distance.

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:47.940
Nope. What do you want to do?

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:50.270
You are the tank. Protect us.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:52.690
What? Uh, no way, no way, no way,
no way, no way, no way, no way!

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:54.610
You should be able to manage it!

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:55.780
You're asking the impossible!

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:57.990
Is it, after all?

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:03.120
Master, you called?

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:06.290
Cast every buff you have on Solomon
for me this very instant.

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.960
Hmm, but before I do...

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:10.840
I request an embrace!

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:12.380
Will this do?

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:15.510
I am satisfied!

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:17.130
Ah!

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.310
Gah! I'm alive!

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:29.400
Impressive as ever, Solomon.

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:31.310
You did well, too, Pam.

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:33.690
It was no trouble at all!

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:38.410
This is the climax.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:45.080
Unleash!

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:59.880
Do it, Eisenfald!

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:22.820
Quest cleared!

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:23.990
Yeah!

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.580
Nice job, peeps!

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:39.760
Are you sure it was all right?

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:40.800
About what?

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:44.680
You're owed a lot of the credit for
how things turned out this time.

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:46.770
But you're not accepting the reward.

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:48.350
If I were to do that,

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:52.400
I would have to publicly declare
that I am Danblf's pupil.

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:56.070
Well, I already ended up
telling those at the Academy,

00:19:56.070 --> 00:19:59.280
but I would say it is too soon
to officially spread the word.

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:01.700
Couldn't the name of Master Danblf's pupil

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:04.820
make up for the rumors that
the Nine Wise Men are absent?

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:08.910
In this guise as a young girl,
some will surely take me lightly.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:12.370
Gathering the others will
serve as a better deterrent.

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:15.920
In order to do that,
this is more convenient.

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:19.920
For I can move freely and even
make time to have tea like this.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.720
Yes, Miss Mira.

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:26.930
But because of that, I am undertaking
all of Master Danblf's duties...

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:31.520
That reminds me, Solomon was grumbling

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:35.400
that some acting Elder took to
the battlefield without permission.

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:37.980
Oh, well, how troubling.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:40.610
I wonder just who in the world
that might have been.

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:42.200
Wha...?

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:43.950
I swear...

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:54.460
To think I would come to be speaking
to you two in this manner...

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:57.170
It makes me happy.

00:20:57.170 --> 00:21:02.380
That I can have tea like this with you,
Master... no, Miss Mira.

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:04.470
Mariana...

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:07.300
My apologies. I...

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:11.560
You'll be going on a journey again, right?

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:17.770
I'll be looking forward to your souvenir.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:19.770
Mm.

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:22.860
For most of the remaining seven
of the Nine Wise Men,

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:24.450
their whereabouts are unknown.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:26.740
There's Chimera Clausen targeting spirits.

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:30.370
Disturbances and the warping of
mana due to the absence of spirits.

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:33.160
The approaching expiration
of the cease-fire agreement.

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:34.870
The problems are piled sky high.

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:38.000
Indeed. Goodness, what a pickle we are in.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:39.750
You're enjoying this
quite a bit, aren't you?

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:41.960
Well, in its own way.

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:46.890
But it would've been nice if the others
had listened to me a bit more.

00:21:46.890 --> 00:21:51.010
If that were the case, they would
not have flocked to your banner.

00:21:52.020 --> 00:21:54.310
I'm going to establish my kingdom here.

00:21:54.310 --> 00:21:58.310
Oh-ho. Will you aim to unify
the continent or some such?

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:00.860
No, something much more interesting.

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:02.190
Meaning?

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:06.530
In this world, with originality and
ingenuity, you can achieve anything.

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:09.120
So, I want to do all sorts of things.

00:22:09.120 --> 00:22:12.410
I want to gather people
who can do all sorts of things.

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:16.830
You say that, but what if you
gather nothing but oddballs?

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:18.290
I'd welcome them with open arms.

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:20.630
If we can find people like you and me...

00:22:21.800 --> 00:22:23.960
Say, with maybe ten of us,

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:26.300
I bet we'll be able to do
some interesting things.

00:22:26.300 --> 00:22:27.800
Did I say that?

00:22:27.800 --> 00:22:30.010
Thanks to that, it never gets boring.

00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:35.230
The state of the world has changed
somewhat, but that is its own thing.

00:22:35.230 --> 00:22:37.350
I think I will head out soon.

00:22:37.350 --> 00:22:38.690
Okay.

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:40.520
Danblf, the One-Man Army...

00:22:40.520 --> 00:22:43.980
No. Mira, she who professes
herself the wise man's pupil,

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:48.450
serve as my hands and eyes
and find the Nine Wise Men!

00:22:48.450 --> 00:22:51.620
As you wish, Your Majesty.

00:22:54.580 --> 00:22:56.330
"The continental railway, meow!"

00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:58.710
"Excited"

00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:58.710
Where are we going next, meow?

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:00.830
"Excited"

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:00.830
First, we go to Soul Howl.

00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:03.460
"I know, let's go to Kyoto."
And after that, is the Isuzu League.

00:23:03.460 --> 00:23:06.800
As I find the movements of
Chimera Clausen disturbing as well.

00:23:06.800 --> 00:23:09.880
I may be able to find
some clues to Kagura.

00:23:09.880 --> 00:23:14.060
I cannot imagine that they
will be so easy to find, but...

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:19.020
Well, I suppose I will go about
enjoying how this world has changed.

00:23:19.020 --> 00:23:19.230
I'll follow you to the ends
of the earth, meow.

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:21.020
"And into legend..."
I'll follow you to the ends
of the earth, meow.

00:23:21.020 --> 00:23:21.940
"And into legend..."
I will be counting on you,
Party Member 1.

00:23:21.940 --> 00:23:23.690
I will be counting on you,
Party Member 1.

00:23:23.690 --> 00:23:25.360
Yes, sir, meow!

00:23:26.280 --> 00:23:28.070
"It's comfortable, meow."

00:23:46.300 --> 00:23:49.050
I am cute!
